Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:32.32,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“A sandbox tested in a week
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:32.32,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}went viral before it was
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:32.32,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,262)\fad(200,0)}open sourced”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:01.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hey everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:02.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,I'm Hang
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.14,0:00:03.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,founder of InsForge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.39,0:00:05.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,And... That's actually a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.18,0:00:05.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,funny story
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.84,0:00:08.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,like last Wednesday
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:09.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,before last Wednesday
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.90,0:00:10.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,we were working on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:11.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,InstaCloud
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.98,0:00:14.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,it's open source backend
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.19,0:00:15.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,cloud infrastructure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.48,0:00:16.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,but we just tested
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.52,0:00:18.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,something really quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.24,0:00:19.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,last Wednesday and it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:19.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,went viral
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.64,0:00:21.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,which is our sandbox
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.02,0:00:21.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,offering
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:22.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,and we don't have time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.46,0:00:23.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,to open source it yet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.82,0:00:25.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,so it's still closed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.12,0:00:26.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,source, but yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:27.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,happy to share more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:28.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,about my...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.75,0:00:29.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,experience of finding
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.77,0:00:31.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,PMF with my previous
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.27,0:00:32.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,products.
